              radial-gradient(circle at 40% 75%, rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.1) 1px, transparent 1px),
              radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%, rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.13) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 100% 100%;
            animation: stars-twinkle 2s ease-in-out infinite;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 1;
          "
        ></span>
      </div>
